<title>USA: Advanced Magnetics names operating chief.</title>
<headline>Advanced Magnetics names operating chief.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Magnetics Inc said Tuesday Leonard M. Baum has been appointed president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company said Jerome Goldstein, formerly president, will retain the responsibilities of chairman of the board and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Baum joined Advanced Magnetics in 1994 as senior vice president, the company said.  Since joining the company he has been involved in clinical and regulatory activities.</p>
</text>
